      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should see a doctor but i really cant afford the copay right now and it's late. is it actually dangerous though? i mean i've taken macrobid before and it worked fine. is there a way to just dose it safely at home so i dont mess up my kidneys or something? maybe a lower dose or something else like high dose vitamin c instead?",
